{
  "info": {
    "name": "MentorBooking API (Gateway)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "## API Gateway — tất cả service\n\n**Base URL:** `https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com`\n\n### Thứ tự chạy Collection Runner\n1. Login → Login as Mentor → Login as Student\n2. List teachers (auto mentor_id) → List students (auto student_id)\n3. Create slot (mentor_token) → auto slot_id\n4. Create booking (student_token) → auto booking_id\n5. Accept booking (mentor_token)\n6. Get meeting by booking id → auto meeting_id\n7. Recordings by meeting id → auto recording_id\n8. Create review (student_token) → auto review_id\n9. Upload from URL (điền video_url trước) → auto transcript_id\n10. Get transcript (poll cho đến Completed)\n\n**Trước khi chạy:** Sửa email/password trong 'Login as Mentor' và 'Login as Student'. Điền video_url nếu muốn test AI Transcript."
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "description": "JWT admin — sau Login" },
    { "key": "mentor_token", "value": "", "description": "JWT mentor — sau Login as Mentor" },
    { "key": "student_token", "value": "", "description": "JWT student — sau Login as Student" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "", "description": "Sau Login" },
    { "key": "mentor_id", "value": "", "description": "Auto từ List teachers" },
    { "key": "student_id", "value": "", "description": "Auto từ List students" },
    { "key": "slot_id", "value": "", "description": "Auto từ Create slot" },
    { "key": "booking_id", "value": "", "description": "Auto từ Create booking" },
    { "key": "meeting_id", "value": "", "description": "Auto từ Get meeting by booking" },
    { "key": "recording_id", "value": "", "description": "Auto từ Recordings by meeting" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "", "description": "Guid — GET /api/users/{id}" },
    { "key": "review_id", "value": "", "description": "Auto từ Create review" },
    { "key": "transcript_id", "value": "", "description": "Auto từ upload/ingest" },
    { "key": "video_url", "value": "", "description": "URL video public — điền tay trước khi test AI" },
    { "key": "zoom_meeting_id", "value": "", "description": "Zoom = Booking.GoogleEventId" },
    { "key": "_ts", "value": "", "description": "Auto Simulate Zoom" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (admin)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
            "var json = pm.response.json(); var data = json.data || json;",
            "var token = (json.data && json.data.accessToken) || json.accessToken || (data && data.accessToken);",
            "if (token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', token); console.log('Admin token saved'); }",
            "var rt = (json.data && json.data.refreshToken) || (data && data.refreshToken);",
            "if (rt) { pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', rt); }"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com/api/auth/login", "host": ["https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com"], "path": ["api","auth","login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as Mentor",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
            "var json = pm.response.json(); var data = json.data || json;",
            "var token = (json.data && json.data.accessToken) || json.accessToken || (data && data.accessToken);",
            "if (token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('mentor_token', token); console.log('Mentor token saved'); }"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"mentor@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"mentor123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com/api/auth/login", "host": ["https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com"], "path": ["api","auth","login"] },
            "description": "Sửa email/password đúng với tài khoản mentor trong DB."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as Student",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
            "var json = pm.response.json(); var data = json.data || json;",
            "var token = (json.data && json.data.accessToken) || json.accessToken || (data && data.accessToken);",
            "if (token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('student_token', token); console.log('Student token saved'); }"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"student123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com/api/auth/login", "host": ["https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com"], "path": ["api","auth","login"] },
            "description": "Sửa email/password đúng với tài khoản student trong DB."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Wakeup (anti sleep)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }, "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com/api/auth", "host": ["https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com"], "path": ["api","auth"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"accessToken\": \"{{token}}\",\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com/api/auth/refresh", "host": ["https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com"], "path": ["api","auth","refresh"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com/api/auth/logout", "host": ["https://api-gateway-lfnu.onrender.com"], "path": ["api","auth","logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
